{{Short description|2022 UK local government election}}
[[File:Crawley UK ward map 2022.svg|thumb|2022 Crawley Borough Council election results map]]
The '''2022 Crawley Borough Council''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Crawley Borough Council]]. This is on the same day as [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|other local elections]]. 12 of the 36 seats were up for election.<ref>{{cite web |title=Election timetable in England |url=https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/election-timetable-in-england/election-timetable-in-england#district-councils2 |website=GOV.UK |access-date=30 April 2022 |language=en}}</ref>

==Background==
In its first election in 1973, Crawley was won by [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour]]. Their control of the council continued until [[2006 Crawley Borough Council election|2006]], when the [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservatives]] took control.<ref>{{cite web |title=Crawley Borough Council Election Results 1973-2012 |url=http://www.electionscentre.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Crawley-1973-2012.pdf |website=Elections Centre |access-date=30 April 2022}}</ref> Labour regained the council in [[2014 Crawley Borough Council election|2014]], and this continued until the [[2021 Crawley Borough Council election|2021 election]], when the Conservatives became the largest party, although Labour continued to govern in coalition with an independent.<ref>{{cite web |last1=Koehler |first1=Ingrid |title=Who runs the councils in No Overall Control? |url=https://lgiu.org/who-runs-the-councils-in-no-overall-control/ |website=Local Government Information Unit |access-date=30 April 2022}}</ref> In that election, the Conservatives gained 1 seat with 48.6% of the vote, Labour lost one seat with 39.5%, and independents made no gains or losses with 0.9%.

The seats up for election in 2022 were last elected in [[2019 Crawley Borough Council election|2019]] due to boundary changes. In that election, Labour won 19 seats with 42.6%, and Conservatives won 17 with 42.6%.<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project - 2019 - Crawley |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/results/2019/357/ |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=6 May 2022}}</ref>

